{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2022-04-21 07:05:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS ON ITS COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCKS', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO , APRIL 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK (NASDAQ: HBAN) OF $0.155 PER COMMON SHARE, UNCHANGED FROM THE PRIOR QUARTER.\xa0 THE COMMON STOCK CASH DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JULY 1, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 17, 2022."}{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2022-04-21 07:00:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED REPORTS 2022 FIRST-QUARTER EARNINGS', 'text': 'MOMENTUM CONTINUES INTO Q1, WITH 2% AVERAGE LOAN GROWTH OR +10% ANNUALIZED, EX PPP. INCREASED NET INTEREST INCOME AND CONSECUTIVE EXPENSE REDUCTIONS DRIVE RECORD PPNR COLUMBUS, OHIO , APRIL\xa021, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- 2022 FIRST-QUARTER HIGHLIGHTS: EARNINGS PER COMMON SHARE (EPS) FOR THE QUARTER WERE $0.29, AN INCREASE OF $0.03 FROM THE PRIOR QUARTER.'}